    "description": "Ultrasonic water meters designed to measure, memorise and display the volume at metering conditions of water passing through the measurement transducer. The meters consist of a brass body with connecting screw threads, one pair of ultrasonic transducers and an electronic indicating device formed by an LCD display showing volume and flow. Volume resolution of 0.001 m³ on the digital display. No buttons; legally non-relevant communication via NFC sensor connected on the register. Software separation with SW version and CRC of the legally relevant part displayed in the auto-rounding menu on the LCD. Displays separately delivered volume for reverse flow and forward flow every ten seconds. Powered by a 3.6 V DC battery. Can be installed in arbitrary positions."
